<h2 id="faq">FAQ</h2>

<h3>Do you write the replacement content too?</h3>
<p>No. The audit covers diagnosis and a per-page action plan. Content writing is available as a separate engagement once the audit defines what needs writing.</p>

<h3>How long does a content audit take?</h3>
<p>Standard and Full Site packages deliver within 7 business days. Large Site engagements are scoped individually based on page count.</p>

<h3>What CMS access do you need?</h3>
<p>None required for the audit itself. Read-only Search Console and Analytics access lets us correlate content quality with actual performance data.</p>

